{"audit_findings": "```json
{
  "analysis_summary": "This ontology captures high-level EDIFACT message structure but suffers from critical flattening errors and missing D96A INVOIC mandatory elements. It models only 2 segment types (BGM, NAD) out of ~18 required segments, achieving approximately 11% segment coverage. The NAD segment lacks qualifier distinctions (BY/SU/DP), and critical segments like DTM, MOA, LIN, QTY, PRI, TAX are entirely absent.",
  "completeness_score": 0.11,
  "extensions_required": [
    {
      "type": "class",
      "name": "DTMSegment with qualifier subclasses (DTM+137 DocumentDate, DTM+35 DeliveryDate, DTM+11 DespatchDate)",
      "priority": "high",
      "rationale": "EANCOM D96A INVOIC mandates DTM+137 (Document Date) as Mandatory in header. Without qualifier-specific modeling, semantic context is lost. Current hasDocumentDate property is insufficient", "owl_reviewed_length": 12471, "consultation_logged": true, "audits_remaining": 1}

